{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/pyi5t9","slide":1,"text":"Hello everyone. My project is about automatic sleep stage classification from EEG.\nThe key idea is to investigate whether one EEG channel can provide enough information to classify five sleep stages automatically.\n[Sources]\n- https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-026-62832-5\n- https://physionet.org/content/sleep-edfx/1.0.0/"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/67yvyp","slide":2,"title":"The research idea is focused and testable","textShapes":18}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5cfalwni","slide":2,"text":"The research idea is focused and testable","textPreview":"The research idea is focused and testable","textChars":41,"textLines":1,"bbox":[70,52,930,50]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/i9orqho7","slide":2,"text":"Reduce the input, preserve the signal information, and evaluate generalization.","textPreview":"Reduce the input, preserve the signal information, and evaluate generalization.","textChars":79,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,115,900,28]}
